  m_text: "- Name the three parts of the axial skeleton.\u200B\r\n\r\n- Identify
    the bones of the axial skeleton, either by examining isolated bones or by pointing
    them out on an articulated skeleton or skull and name the important bone markings
    on each.\u200B\r\n\r\n- Name and describe the different types of vertebrae.\u200B\r\n\rDiscuss
    the importance of intervertebral discs and spinal curvatures.\u200B\r\n\r\n-
    Identify three abnormal spinal curvatures.\u200B\r\n\r\n- List the components
    of the thoracic cage.\u200B\r\n\n"
