  m_text: '- Deoxygenated blood enters the right atrium from the body.

    - It
    moves to the right ventricle and is pumped to the lungs.

    - Oxygenated blood
    from the lungs enters the left atrium.

    - It then moves to the left ventricle
    and is pumped out to the body.'
