  m_text: 'Mitral valve: Between the left atrium and ventricle, it allows blood into
    the left ventricle.


    Aortic valve: Between the left ventricle and aorta,
    it lets oxygen-rich blood flow to the body.


    These valves open and close
    due to pressure changes, ensuring efficient heart function.'
