  m_text: 'Along with direct and poke interactions using your hands in VR, you will
    also notice rays coming form your hands. These rays are like extensions of your
    hands. You can use them to interact with with menus and buttons. Tap your finger
    and thumb together to select. You can also use them to grab objects close or
    up to 5 meters away. Try grabbing the car and house. You can close all menus
    by pushing the blue button.

'
